, CD40-positive, CD44-negative, CD45RO-positive, CD49a-positive, CD49b-positive, CD49c-negative, CD49d-negative, CD49e-positive, CD49f-negative, CD56-negative, CD58-positive, CD61-positive, CD64-positive, CD70-negative, CD71-positive, CD80-positive, CD83-negative, CD86-positive, CD103-negative, CD105-positive, CD181-positive, CD182-negative, CD183-positive, CD184-positive, CD185-negative, CD186-negative, CD191-positive, CD192-negative, CD193-positive, CD194-positive, CD195-positive, CD196-negative, CD197-positive, CD199-positive, desmin-negative, F4/80-positive, Gr1-positive, LSP-1-positive, MHCI-positive, MHCII-positive, alpha-SMA-negative, TCRab-negative, TCRgd-negative, and vimentin-positive. Fibrocytes are also capable of secreting angiogenin, bFGF, CCL2, CCL3, CCL4, CCL8, CXCL1, type I collagen, type III collagen, CTGF, fibronectin, GM-CSF, IL-1a, IL-6, IL-8, IL-10, M-CSF, MMP-9, PDGF-A, TGF-alpha, TGF-beta1, TNF-alpha, and VEGF-A.\")\n\n  Line 5071: AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label obo:CL_0000135 \"circulating fibrocyte\")\n\n  Line 5072: SubClassOf(Annotation(oboInOwl:is_inferred \"true\") obo:CL_0000135 obo:CL_0000499)\n\n  Line 5073: SubClassOf(obo:CL_0000135 obo:CL_0011026)\n\n  Line 5074: SubClassOf(obo:CL_0000135 ObjectSomeValuesFrom(obo:RO_0002202 obo:CL_0000839))\n\n  Line 5075: SubClassOf(obo:CL_0000135 ObjectSomeValuesFrom(obo:RO_0002215 obo:GO_0002495))\n\n  Line 5076: SubClassOf(obo:CL_0000135 ObjectSomeValuesFrom(obo:RO_0002215 obo:GO_0042060))\n\n  Line 5077: SubClassOf(obo:CL_0000135 ObjectSomeValuesFrom(obo:RO_0002215 obo:GO_0045766))\n\n  Line 25729: EquivalentClasses(obo:CL_1000308 ObjectIntersectionOf(obo:CL_0000135 ObjectSomeValuesFrom(obo:BFO_0000050 obo:UBERON_0001252)))\n\n  Line 25730: SubClassOf(Annotation(oboInOwl:is_inferred \"true\") obo:CL_1000308 obo:CL_0000135)\n\n  Line 27390: SubClassOf(obo:CL_1000693 obo:CL_0000135)\n","metadata":{"matches":90,"truncated":false},"title":"CL_0000135","time":{"start":1778527547888,"end":1778527547